<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I’m dry but I long to be swallowed by life.</l><l>I’m weak but am coming and opening wide.</l><l>Spring up well! Spring up in me!</l><l>Spring up well! Unto eternity!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The wells of salvation are flowing and free.</l><l>Thirsty and weary, just open and see.</l><l>They are free! Come and see!</l><l>They are free! Open your mouth and you’ll see!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>I open a little and in comes the tide.</l><l>The more that I drink, the more I’m satisfied.</l><l>So I come—desperate for life.</l><l>And I come—Lord, give me life or I die!</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Zoe’s the answer and Zoe’s the key.</l><l>Zoe’s my goal and Zoe’s my need.</l><l>I need God’s life—to flood o’er my soul.</l><l>I need God’s life—to fill me within and o’er flow!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
